---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'New Website';
const date = '2020-01-10';
const category = 'News';
---

<BaseLayout title={`${title} - Dasher Blog`}>
  <div class="container-narrow">
    <article class="blog-post">
      <header class="blog-header">
        <div class="blog-meta">
          <time datetime={date}>
            {new Date(date).toLocaleDateString('en-US', {
              year: 'numeric',
              month: 'long',
              day: 'numeric',
            })}
          </time>
          <span class="blog-tag">{category}</span>
        </div>
        <h1>{title}</h1>
      </header>

      <div class="blog-content">
        <p>
          Welcome to the new Dasher website! We've updated our online presence to better serve our
          community and provide improved documentation for the Dasher project.
        </p>

        <h2>What's New</h2>
        <p>
          The new website features:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Modern Design</strong> - A fresh look with improved accessibility</li>
          <li><strong>Better Documentation</strong> - Reorganized and expanded documentation</li>
          <li><strong>Community Hub</strong> - Easier ways to connect with other users and developers</li>
          <li><strong>Mobile-Friendly</strong> - Works great on phones and tablets</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Documentation</h2>
        <p>
          We've completely reorganized our documentation to make it easier to find what you need.
          Whether you're just getting started with Dasher or looking for advanced configuration
          options, our new documentation structure should help.
        </p>

        <h2>Community</h2>
        <p>
          The Dasher community is what makes this project special. We've added new ways to connect:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Join our <a href="https://matrix.to/#/#dasher:matrix.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Matrix chat room</a> for real-time discussions</li>
          <li>Follow our development on <a href="https://github.com/dasher-project/dasher" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a></li>
          <li>Read and contribute to the documentation</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Feedback Welcome</h2>
        <p>
          This is an ongoing project, and we welcome feedback on the new website. If you spot any
          issues or have suggestions for improvements, please let us know on GitHub or Matrix.
        </p>
      </div>

      <footer class="blog-footer">
        <a href="/blog/" class="btn-secondary">← Back to Blog</a>
      </footer>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .blog-post {
    padding: var(--space-xl) 0;
  }

  .blog-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .blog-meta {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .blog-tag {
    background-color: var(--color-horizon-mint);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .blog-header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.5rem);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .blog-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-horizon-mint);
  }

  .blog-content ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .blog-content li {
    padding-left: var(--space-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    position: relative;
  }

  .blog-content li::before {
    content: '•';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-target-coral);
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .blog-content strong {
    color: var(--color-deep-ink);
  }

  .blog-footer {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
    padding-top: var(--space-lg);
    border-top: 2px solid var(--color-horizon-mint);
  }
</style>
